  "Software Details": "Softwaredetails",
  "The Dash Saas Bookings Module makes managing your appointments simple and hassle-free. Our easy-to-use interface lets you set up and adjust booking slots quickly, ensuring your calendar is always up-to-date. Whether you are a solo business owner or managing a team, our scheduling tool adapts to your needs. From one-time meetings to recurring appointments, you’ll stay organized and in control with ease.": "Das Dash Saas-Buchungsmodul macht die Verwaltung Ihrer Termine einfach und problemlos. ",
  "/Month": "/Monat",
  "/Year": "/Jahr",
  "Buy Now": "Jetzt kaufen",
  "View Live Demo": "Live-Demo ansehen",
  "Simplify Your Schedule with Dash SaaS Booking Module": "Vereinfachen Sie Ihren Zeitplan mit dem Dash SaaS-Buchungsmodul",
  "Streamline your scheduling with Dash SaaS Booking. Integrated seamlessly into the Dash Saas platform, our intuitive module minimizes conflicts and enhances customer satisfaction. Simplify appointments effortlessly.": "Optimieren Sie Ihre Terminplanung mit Dash SaaS Booking. ",
  "Great Customer Experience": "Tolles Kundenerlebnis",
  "Providing a great customer experience is simple with the Dash Saas Bookings Module. Clients can book appointments anytime through an easy online portal. Automatic confirmations and reminders help reduce no-shows, keeping everyone informed and prepared. The seamless integration with your website and social media allows clients to book services without leaving their favorite platforms, making the process smooth and convenient.": "Mit dem Dash Saas-Buchungsmodul ist es ganz einfach, ein großartiges Kundenerlebnis zu bieten. ",
  "Easy Integration and Customization": "Einfache Integration und Anpassung",
  "Our Bookings Module works well with the tools you already use. Easily integrate with popular calendar apps like Google Calendar and Outlook to keep all your schedules in sync. Customize booking forms and workflows to fit your business needs. Whether you need to collect detailed information upfront or offer different service options, our module allows you to create a booking experience that matches your brand.": "Unser Buchungsmodul funktioniert gut mit den Tools, die Sie bereits verwenden. ",
  "Useful Analytics": "Nützliche Analysen",
  "Get valuable insights into your booking trends and business performance with the Dash Saas Bookings Module/s analytics. Track important metrics like appointment numbers, peak booking times, and customer preferences. Use this data to make better decisions about staffing, marketing, and services. Our simple reports and dashboards give you a clear view of how your booking system is doing, helping you improve efficiency and profitability. Plus, you can manage bookings from both the backend and frontend, giving you complete control and flexibility over your scheduling process.": "Erhalten Sie wertvolle Einblicke in Ihre Buchungstrends und Geschäftsleistung mit den Analysen des Dash Saas Bookings Module/s. ",
  "Online Payments": "Online-Zahlungen",
  "With the Dash Saas Bookings Module, customers can pay for their appointments online quickly and securely. We support major payment gateways like Stripe and PayPal, making it easy for clients to complete transactions. This feature not only enhances convenience but also ensures that payments are processed efficiently, reducing the risk of missed payments and improving your cash flow. Offering online payment options helps streamline your business operations and provides a seamless experience for your customers.": "Mit dem Dash Saas Bookings Module können Kunden ihre Termine schnell und sicher online bezahlen. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "Warum dedizierte Module wählen?",
  "for your business?": "für Ihr Unternehmen?",
